      "contextFingerprint": "58e6494300cb5995f1d11579720b55c3fadfc0fdd0918d4b9c81334d911143fa",
      "sourceText": "本节点近似配对的是 `Odometry` 和 `Path`，不是带时间戳的速度；输入速度没有时间戳，只缓存最近值。收到局部路径会刷新“控制器活跃”时间；最近0.5秒内有路径时，非零速度等待配对回调处理，否则直接按当前保存的 yaw 转换。近似配对不能证明路径、位姿、速度对应同一时刻。",
      "translatedText": "This node approximately pairs `Odometry` and `Path`; it is not a timestamped velocity\\. The input velocity has no timestamp, and only the most recent value is cached\\. Receiving a local path refreshes the \"controller active\" time\\. When there is a path within the last 0\\.5 seconds, a nonzero velocity waits for the pairing callback to process it; otherwise, it is directly converted using the currently saved yaw\\. Approximate pairing cannot prove that the path, pose, and velocity correspond to the same instant in time\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 209,
        "outputTokens": 112,
        "costUsd": 0.000198
      }
